#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced Editing Tools"
msgstr "Ferramentas de edición avanzada"

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "Comment/Uncomment"
msgstr "Comentarios de código"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:15
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "The Comment and Uncomment commands, available from the <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu allow you to add or remove comment markers to the selection, or the current line if no text is selected, if comments are supported by the format of the text you are editing."
msgid "The <guimenuitem>Comment</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Uncomment</guimenuitem> commands, available from the <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> menu allow you to add or remove comment markers to the selection, or the current line if no text is selected, if comments are supported by the format of the text you are editing."
msgstr "As ordes «Comentar» e «Descomentar», dispoñibeis no menú <guimenu>Utilidades</guimenu>, permiten engadir ou retirar marcas de comentario do texto seleccionado —ou da liña actual se non se seleccionou nada— nos casos nos que o formato do texto que se está a editar permite o uso de comentarios."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "The rules for how commenting is done are defined in the syntax definitions, so if syntax highlighting is not used, commenting/uncommenting is not possible."
msgstr "As regras para comentar e descomentar defínense nas definicións da sintaxe, así que en caso de non usar o realzado da sintaxe, a funcionalidade de comentar e descomentar non estará dispoñíbel."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Some formats define single line comment markers, some multiline markers and some both. If multiline markers are not available, commenting out a selection that does not fully include its last line is not possible."
msgstr "Algúns formatos definen marcas de comentarios dunha liña, outros de comentarios de varias liñas, e outros dispoñen de ambos os dous tipos de comentarios. Nos casos nos que non se dispoña de marcas de comentarios de varias liñas, non será posíbel comentar un texto seleccionado que non inclúa a totalidade das liñas que abrangue."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "If a single line marker is available, commenting single lines is preferred where applicable, as this helps to avoid problems with nested comments."
msgstr "Cando haxa dispoñibeis marcas de comentarios dunha soa liña, usaranse ditas marcas cando sexa posíbel, dado que os comentarios dunha soa liña axudan a evitar problemas coa aniñación de comentarios."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "When removing comment markers, no uncommented text should be selected. When removing multiline comment markers from a selection, any whitespace outside the comment markers is ignored."
msgstr "Ao retirar marcas de comentarios, non debería seleccionarse texto que non dispoña de tales. Ao retirar marcadores de comentarios de varias liñas dunha selección, calquera espazo en branco fóra das marcas de comentario ignorarase."

#. Tag: primary
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>comment</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>comentar</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:38
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "To place comment markers, use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Comment</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item or the related keyboard shortcut sequence, default is <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."
msgid "To place comment markers, use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Comment</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item or the related keyboard shortcut sequence, the default is <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr "Para engadir marcas de comentario, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Utilidades</guimenu><guimenuitem>Comentar</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou o atallo de teclado correspondente. O atallo predeterminado é <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: primary
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>uncomment</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>descomentar</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:44
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "To remove comment markers, use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uncomment</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item or the related keyboard shortcut, default is <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."
msgid "To remove comment markers, use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Uncomment</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item or the related keyboard shortcut, the default is <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr "Para retirar marcas de comentario, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Utilidades</guimenu><guimenuitem>Descomentar</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou o atallo de teclado correspondente. O atallo predeterminado é <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo>."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Editor Component Command Line"
msgstr "A liña de ordes do compoñente de edición"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:55
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&kappname;'s editor component has an internal command line, allowing you to perform various actions from a minimal GUI. The command line is a text entry in the bottom of the editor area, to show it select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Switch to Command Line</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or use the shortcut (default is <keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo>). The editor provides a set of commands as documented below, and additional commands can be provided by plugins."
msgid "&kappname;'s editor component has an internal command line, allowing you to perform various actions from a minimal &GUI;. The command line is a text entry at the bottom of the editor area; to show it select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Switch to Command Line</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or use the shortcut (default is <keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo>). The editor provides a set of commands as documented below, and additional commands can be provided by plugins."
msgstr "O compoñente de edición de &kappname; conta cunha liña de ordes interna, o que permite levar a cabo varias accións desde unha interface gráfica mínima. A liña de ordes consiste nun campo de texto na parte inferior da zona de edición, que pode amosarse desde <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guimenuitem>Cambiar á liña de ordes</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou mediante o atallo de teclado correspondente (<keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo> é o predeterminado). O editor fornece unha serie de ordes de seu —listadas a continuación—, e a lista de ordes dispoñibeis pode estenderse mediante complementos."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "To execute a command, type the command then press the return key. The command line will indicate whether it succeeded and possibly display a message. If you entered the command line by pressing <keycap>F7</keycap> it will automatically hide after a few seconds. To clear the message and enter a new command, press <keycap>F7</keycap> again."
msgstr "Para executar unha orde, introdúzaa no campo de texto e prema a tecla Intro. A liña de ordes indicará se a orde se executou correctamente, e posibelmente amose unha mensaxe. Se accedeu á liña de ordes mediante o atallo de teclado (<keycap>F7</keycap>), esta agocharase automaticamente despois duns segundos. Para retirar a mensaxe e inserir unha nova orde, volva usar o atallo de teclado."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:70
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "The command line has a built-in help system, issue the command <command>help</command> to get started. To see a list of all available commands issue <command>help list</command>, to view help for a specific command, do <command>help <replaceable>command</replaceable></command>."
msgid "The command line has a built-in help system; issue the command <command>help</command> to get started. To see a list of all available commands issue <command>help list</command>; to view help for a specific command, do <command>help <replaceable>command</replaceable></command>."
msgstr "A liña de ordes conta cun sistema de axuda integrado. Execute a orde <command>help</command>; aparecerá unha mensaxe cunha pequena introdución á liña de ordes de &kappname; e o sue sistema de axuda. Para obter unha lista das ordes dispoñibeis, execute <command>help list</command>, e para obter axuda sobre unha orde concreta, execute <command>help <replaceable>orde</replaceable></command>."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:75
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "The command line has a built in history, so you can reuse commands already typed. To navigate the history, use the <keycap>Up</keycap> and <keycap>Down</keycap> keys. When showing historical commands, the argument part of the command will be selected, allowing you to easily overwrite the arguments."
msgid "The command line has a built in history, so you can reuse commands already typed. To navigate the history, use the &Up; and &Down; keys. When showing historical commands, the argument part of the command will be selected, allowing you to easily overwrite the arguments."
msgstr "A liña de ordes ten ademais un historial integrado que permite reusar ordes empregadas anteriormente. Para examinar o historial, use as teclas <keycap>↑</keycap> and <keycap>↓</keycap>. Ao escoller unha orde do historial, a parte dos argumentos seleccionarase de maneira automática, permitindo cambiar estes facilmente."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard Command Line Commands"
msgstr "Ordes estándar"

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Argument types"
msgstr "Tipos de argumento"

#. Tag: term
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "BOOLEAN"
msgstr "BOOLEANO"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is used with commands that turns things on or off. Legal values are <userinput>on</userinput>, <userinput>off</userinput>, <userinput>true</userinput>, <userinput>false</userinput>, <userinput>1</userinput> or <userinput>0</userinput>."
msgstr "Empregado con ordes que activan ou desactivan cousas. Os seus posíbeis valores son: <userinput>on</userinput>, <userinput>off</userinput>, <userinput>true</userinput>, <userinput>false</userinput>, <userinput>1</userinput> ou <userinput>0</userinput>."

#. Tag: term
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "INTEGER"
msgstr "ENTEIRO"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "An integer number."
msgstr "Un número enteiro."

#. Tag: term
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "STRING"
msgstr "CADEA"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "A string, surrounded by single quotes (') or double quotes (\") when it contains spaces."
msgstr "Unha cadea, delimitada por comiñas simples (') ou dobres (\") cando contén espazos."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commands for Configuring the Editor"
msgstr "Ordes para configurar o editor"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:112
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "These commands are provided by the editor component, and allows you to configure the active document and view only. This is handy if you want to use a setting different from the default settings, for example for indentation."
msgid "These commands are provided by the editor component, and allow you to configure the active document and view only. This is handy if you want to use a setting different from the default settings, for example for indentation."
msgstr "As seguintes ordes permiten configurar o documento e vista activos con independencia dos demais. Resultan útiles cando se quere usar unha configuración diferente da predeterminada, por exemplo para o sangrado."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-tab-width</command><arg choice=\"req\">INTEGER width</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-tab-width</command><arg choice=\"req\">ENTEIRO anchura</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the tab width to the number <userinput>width</userinput>."
msgstr "Usar o valor <userinput>anchura</userinput> para a anchura das tabulacións."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-indent-width</command><arg choice=\"req\">INTEGER width</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-indent-width</command><arg choice=\"req\">ENTEIRO anchura</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the indentation width to the number <userinput>width</userinput>. Used only if you are indenting with spaces."
msgstr "Usar o valor <userinput>anchura</userinput> para a anchura do sangrado. Só ten efecto ao usar espazos para o sangrado."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-word-wrap-column</command><arg choice=\"req\">INTEGER width</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-word-wrap-column</command><arg choice=\"req\">ENTEIRO anchura</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the line width for hard wrapping to <userinput>width</userinput>. This is used if you are having your text wrapped automatically."
msgstr "Usar o valor <userinput>anchura</userinput> para a anchura máxima das liñas. Só ten efecto ao usar a división fixa das liñas."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-icon-border</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-icon-border</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the visibility of the icon border."
msgstr "Define a visibilidade do bordo da icona."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-folding-markers</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-folding-markers</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the visibility of the folding markers pane."
msgstr "Define a visibilidade do panel dos marcadores de pregado."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-line-numbers</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-line-numbers</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the visibility of the line numbers pane."
msgstr "Determina a visibilidade do panel dos números de liña."

# skip-rule: trasno-tab
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-replace-tabs</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-replace-tabs</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "If enabled, tabs are replaced with spaces as you type."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), as tabulacións substituiranse por espazos a medida que se escriban."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-remove-trailing-space</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-remove-trailing-space</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:162
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "If enabled, trailing whitespace are removed whenever the cursor leaves a line."
msgid "If enabled, trailing whitespace is removed whenever the cursor leaves a line."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), os espazos (innecesarios) á dereita da liña na que estea o cursor eliminaranse cando o cursor cambie a outra liña."

# skip-rule: trasno-tab
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-show-tabs</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-show-tabs</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "If enabled, TAB characters and trailing whitespace will be visualized by a small dot."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), as tabulacións e os espazos innecesarios representaranse con pequenos puntos."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-show-indent</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-show-indent</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "If enabled, indentation will be visualized by a vertical dotted line."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), o sangrado representarase cunha liña de puntos vertical."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-indent-spaces</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-indent-spaces</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "If enabled, the editor will indent with <option>indent-width</option> spaces for each indentation level, rather than with one TAB character."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), o editor usará a cantidade de espazos definida na opción <option>indent-width</option> para cada nivel de sangrado, en vez dunha tabulación."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-mixed-indent</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-mixed-indent</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "If enabled, &kappname; will use a mix of TAB and spaces for indentation. Each indentation level will be <option>indent-width</option> wide, and more indentation levels will be optimized to use as many TAB characters as possible."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), &kappname; usará unha mestura de tabulacións e espazos para o sangrado. Cada nivel de sangrado terá unha anchura equivalente ao valor da opción <option>indent-width</option>, e os sucesivos niveis de sangrado optimizaranse para usar cantas tabulacións sexan posíbeis. Por exemplo, se <option>indent-width</option> vale «2», e as tabulacións están configuradas para ter unha anchura de «4»: 1 nivel de sangrado equivalerá a dous espazos, 2 niveis equivalerán a unha tabulación, e 3 niveis equivalerán a unha tabulación seguida de dous espazos."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "When executed, this command will additionally set space indentation enabled, and if the indent width is unspecified it will be set to half of the <option>tab-width</option> for the document at the time of execution."
msgstr "Ao executarse esta orde, activarase automaticamente o sangrado con espazos, e en caso de non estar definida a anchura de sangrado, daráselle como valor a metade do valor da propiedade <option>tab-width</option> do documento activo no momento de execución da orde."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-word-wrap</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-word-wrap</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:199
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Enables dynamic word wrap according to <userinput>enable</userinput>"
msgid "Enables dynamic word wrap according to <userinput>enable</userinput>."
msgstr "Activa (on) ou desactiva (off) a división visual das liñas."

# skip-rule: trasno-tab
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-replace-tabs-save</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable </arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-replace-tabs-save</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid "When enabled, tabs will be replaced with whitespace whenever the document is saved."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), as tabulacións substituiranse por espazos cada vez que se garde o documento."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-remove-trailing-space-save</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN enable</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-remove-trailing-space-save</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "When enabled, trailing space will be removed from each line whenever the document is saved."
msgstr "Ao activarse (on), os espazos (innecesarios) á dereita de cada liña retiraranse ao gardar o documento."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-indent-mode</command><arg choice=\"req\">STRING name</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-indent-mode</command><arg choice=\"req\">CADEA nome</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the autoindentation mode to <userinput>name</userinput>. If <userinput>name</userinput> is not known, the mode is set to 'none'. Valid modes are 'none', 'normal', 'cstyle', 'haskell', 'lilypond', 'lisp', 'python', 'ruby' and 'xml'."
msgstr "Cambia o modo de sangrado automático ao <userinput>nome</userinput>. O seguintes son os valores correctos para o argumento <userinput>nome</userinput>: «none» (desactivación do sangrado automático), «normal», «cstyle» (sangrado de C), «haskell», «lilypond», «lisp», «python», «ruby» e «xml». Se non se recoñece o valor de <userinput>nome</userinput>, desactivarase o sangrado automático."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>set-auto-ident</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEAN script</arg>"
msgstr "<command>set-auto-ident</command><arg choice=\"req\">BOOLEANO activar</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable or disable autoindentation."
msgstr "Activar ou desactivar o sangrado automático."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:230
