#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid "This command does a sed-like search/replace operation on the current line, or on the whole file (<command>%s///</command>)."
msgstr "Busca ou substitución de estilo sed na liña actual, ou en todo o ficheiro (<command>%s///</command>)."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:433
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "In short, the text is searched for text matching the <emphasis>search pattern</emphasis>, the regular expression between the first and the second slash, and when a match is found, the matching part of the text is replaced with the expression between the middle and last part of the string. Parentheses in the search pattern create <emphasis>back references</emphasis>, that is the command remembers which part of the match matched in the parentheses; these strings can be reused in the replace pattern, referred to as <userinput>\\1</userinput> for the first set of parentheses, <userinput>\\2</userinput> for the second and so on."
msgid "In short, the text is searched for text matching the <emphasis>search pattern</emphasis>, the regular expression between the first and the second slash, and when a match is found, the matching part of the text is replaced with the expression between the second and last slash. Parentheses in the search pattern create <emphasis>back references</emphasis>, that is the command remembers which part of the string matched in the parentheses; these strings can be reused in the replace pattern, referred to as <userinput>\\1</userinput> for the first set of parentheses, <userinput>\\2</userinput> for the second and so on."
msgstr "En resumo, búscase texto que coincida co <emphasis>patrón de busca</emphasis> (a expresión regular entre a primeira e a segunda barra), e cando se atope unha coincidencia, esta substituirase polo texto entre a segunda e a terceira barra. Os parénteses no patrón de busca crean <emphasis>referencias</emphasis>; é dicir, a parte da coincidencia que estea entre parénteses poderá volver usarse no texto de substitución. Use <userinput>\\1</userinput> para usar o contido dos primeiros parénteses no texto de substitución, <userinput>\\2</userinput> para o segundo par de parénteses, etc."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid "To search for a literal <literal>(</literal> or <literal>)</literal>, you need to <emphasis>escape</emphasis> it using a backslash character: <userinput>\\(\\)</userinput>"
msgstr "Para incluír parénteses no patrón de busca e que estes teñan que coincidir con parénteses no texto atopado en vez de crear referencias, debe <emphasis>escapalos</emphasis> prefixándoos cunha barra: <userinput>\\(\\)</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you put an <userinput>i</userinput> at the end of the expression, the matching will be case insensitive. If you put a <userinput>g</userinput> at the end, all occurrences of the pattern will be replaced, otherwise only the first occurrence is replaced."
msgstr "Se pon un <userinput>i</userinput> ao final da expresión, a busca non distinguirá entre maiúsculas e minúsculas. Se pon un <userinput>g</userinput>, substituiranse todas as coincidencias co padrón —en caso contrario só se fará unha substitución por liña—."

#. Tag: title
#. +> trunk6 stable6
#: advanced.docbook:455
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replacing text in the current line"
msgstr "Substitución de texto na liña actual"

